libu8ident NEWS -- history of user-visible changes.  -*-indented-text-*-
Copyright (C) 2022, 2026 Reini Urban

libu8ident 0.5.1 - unreleased

Fix supplementary-plane nonspacing-mark checks on Windows, where wchar_t
  stores UTF-16 surrogate pairs
Restore enforced MinGW build, test, and pkg CI.

libu8ident 0.5 - 2026-09-29

Implement U8ID_FOLDCASE: it was declared and accepted into the options
bitmask but silently ignored (GH #31). u8ident_check/u8ident_check_buf
now simple-case-fold the identifier before checking/normalizing when
set. Main library only; no-op in the TR39 amalgam (libu8ident_c).
Add u8ident_copy_ctx() for profile switching (fixes #16).
Add u8ident_normalize_static(): allocation-free normalization variant
  (fixes #19); document u8ident_normalize() parameters (fixes #22).
Update to Unicode 18.

Add libu8ident_c: a single self-contained TR39 amalgam library for C
  compiler integration, generated by mk-tr39-amalgam.pl from u8idscr.c.
  Tested also with my C compiler rcc.
Add libu8ident_c build integration: CMake target, .pc file, unifdef
  checks, autotools rules; fix circular unitr39.h/mktr39 dependencies.
Add example_c.c and libu8ident_c API docs/tests; verify all TR39
  codepoints are NFC-stable (#27).

Rename public preprocessor defines to the U8ID_ prefix; remove unused
  tr31_funcs table and a redundant LOCAL/EXTERN block.
Fix u8ident_new_ctx (memset/calloc/realloc off-by-one, OOM abort) and
  u8ident_existing_scripts (exact two-pass allocation).
Fix u8ident_is_greek_latin_confus HAVE_CONFUS guard and --with-roaring.
Wrap all confusable checks in #ifdef HAVE_CONFUS.

Fix broken auto-regeneration rules for scripts16.h and u8id_gc.h.
Fix markdown lint issues in README.md; add pre-commit config; harmonize
  formatting.

libu8ident 0.4 - 2026-03-18

Update to Unicode version 16.0 and 17.0:
  - New scripts and mark ranges.
  - Updated normalization, confusable, and script tables.
Rename c26 helpers and headers to tr39 (the TR39 standard they implement).
Rename outdated TR31/PROFILE names; remove SAFEC26 alias.
Add --disable-dollar / -DALLOW_DOLLAR=OFF configure option (GH #25)
  to exclude U+0024 $ from identifier characters.
Add _ U+005F to the TR31 C23 identifier list.
Fix multiple scripts detection issues.
Fix invalid GC_Mc splits in unitr39.h.
Fix wrong check_buf and u8id_errors documentation.
Fix -Wreturn-local-addr warning.
Fix make regen-norm on pristine checkout.
cmake: bump versions, fix Windows CPack packaging.
Upgrade to autoconf 2.72.

libu8ident 0.3 - 2022-12-03

Fixed a bug with excluded scripts which are only now addable.
Change is_greek_latin_confus violations with TR39_4 to return ERR_CONFUS,
not ERR_SCRIPTS (GH #12).
Add more combining marks checks (GH #7): TR39#5.5 "Forbid sequences of base character
+ nonspacing mark that look the same as or confusingly similar to the base character
alone". Also forbid non-spacing marks with base chars already including the
non-spacing mark, like Ä with DIAERESIS.
Update to Unicode version 15.0.0:
  - 11 new mark ranges.
  - 2 new Excluded scripts: Kawi, Nag Mundari.
  - The zero width joiner (ZWJ) and zero width non-joiner (ZWNJ) changed to IdStatus
    Restricted.
  - More id and xid chars

libu8ident 0.2 - 2022-02-12:

Bump SOLIB MAJOR to 1
The C++23 deadline is gone, rename all c23 to c26. Esp. command-line
and configure options.
Fixed TR39 to exclude confusable Technical, and to skip a lot of
not Allowed ID_Start ranges.

libu8ident 0.1 - 2022-01-24:

First release, with the library, u8idlint and lots of C23 support:
the optimized unic23.h, and the 2 technical papers for C23++ and C23
to use TR39.
